title: POST /repos/:repo/fold
tags: [[HTTP endpoint]] Storage
kind: reference
audience: dev
summary: Folds what writes left pending now, one list at a time, instead of waiting for the repository to be quiet.

No body; answers `{"folded": n}`, the number of lists folded (`0` when nothing was pending).
The connection is free between two lists, so what arrives meanwhile waits for one list
([[Folding in idle time]]). Not an activity signal of its own kind: like any request it
counts as activity.
